WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.073
After the Russian army was

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.942
forced to retreat around Kiev.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:12.045
The carnage came to light

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.047
Butcher board, Yanco

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:16.016
and many other Kiev suburbs

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.984
littered with bodies.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.486
Ukraine especially blames

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.921
one Russian unit for alleged crimes here.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.123
The 64th

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.524
separate guards motor

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.726
rifle brigade from eastern Siberia.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.429
Now, a deserter from that unit

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.231
is speaking to CNN.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.300
Actually, big lie for me like 24

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:35.935
February coming I think.

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:36.569
Okay

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:39.339
everyone goes to war.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.007
Nikita Sebring defected

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.075
from the Russian military

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.376
and fled to Europe,

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.445
where we met him in a secret location.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.814
He shows me his military booklet

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.082
with a stamp signed

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:51.151
by the commander of the 64th Motor

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:53.253
Rifle Brigade Colonel Azar Beck.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.421
Ormeau Bake-Off.

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.588
Known in Ukraine

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.590
as The Butcher of Butcher,

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.259
Chipman says he and his comrades

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.428
were given shoot to kill orders.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:02.929
Even though Russia has denied

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.498
any wrongdoing by its forces around Kiev.

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.467
I got one as well, but I'm like, I'm on.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.069
We had a direct command to murder

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.004
those who divulged our positions.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.205
If someone had a phone,

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:14.107
we were allowed to shoot him.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.642
Kuban says the unit was deployed

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.543
to Belarus

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:18.078
shortly before the invasion,

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.846
allegedly for training.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:21.347
The soldiers had no idea

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.550
they would soon advance into Ukraine,

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.451
and he says

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.786
they weren't prepared for war.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:29.289
If you do you like around?

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.724
Everyone thought they could be like Rambo

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.493
Those who said I would be shooting

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:36.062
Ukrainians easily. Piece of cake.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.297
When they went to the front line

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:39.165
and then they came back, they were like,

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.101
We don't want no war.

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.302
Jubrin says he, too,

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.504
came under Ukrainian artillery shelling

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.206
and showed us this video

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:47.340
from near the town

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.843
lip picker west of Kiev.

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:51.778
He tells me he refused to fight

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.546
because he was opposed to the war

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:54.481
and that his commanders

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.682
called him a coward

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.450
and reassigned him to menial

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.486
labor tasks in the rear echelon.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.154
He says he didn't witness

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.423
the mass killings the unit is accused of,

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.825
but did witness plenty of crimes

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.560
against Ukrainian civilians,

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.761
including looting.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.663
They weren't trying to hide it.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:11.798
They did this very openly.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:14.501
She is saying, look, you know,

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.703
this is so embarrassing what it is.

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:18.571
They say, whoa, I want to do this.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.172
I want this.

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:19.973
The everything,

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:21.274
make the loot and cars

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:23.042
to make the looting

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.612
and even rape this individual.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:27.847
I saw rapists running around being chased

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.582
because they were committed rape

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:31.684
the guys who did rape, I saw them run.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:33.486
Then I learned they were rapists.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.355
They raped a mother and daughter.

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:37.724
They were never jailed.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:38.725
Just fired.

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:41.027
Just like that. Go.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.095
CNN has reached out

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:42.962
to the Russian defense

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:44.097
ministry for comment,

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:46.332
but we haven't received a reply.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:48.201
Russia has consistently denied

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:50.436
its forces were responsible for crimes

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:52.305
against Ukrainian civilians.

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.907
And President Vladimir Putin

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:55.108
issued a decree

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:56.876
praising the 64

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:58.411
separate guards, Motor Rifle

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.679
Brigade for, quote,

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.948
heroism and bold actions.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:05.151
Nikita Chiba fled Russia while on leave.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.252
He gets emotional

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.854
when talking about his four year

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:10.557
old daughter. He left behind.

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:11.925
He says he wants to testify

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:12.892
against his commanders

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.961
before an international court.

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:15.762
To shed light on

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:17.030
what happened in the war.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.266
He never wanted to be a part of

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.569
and he said, Wolf,

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:24.170
the soldier said that discipline

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:25.738
was a huge issue in that unit.

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.507
He felt that the officers

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:28.641
were his commanders

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:29.976
in many cases, were indifferent

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:30.577
to the mission,

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:32.011
indifferent to their own soldiers,

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.780
and also, of course, indifferent

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.048
to the lives of the Ukrainians,

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:36.382
the civilians that were on the ground

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:37.350
there as well.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.051
He also says

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:39.285
he doesn't believe that Russia

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.287
is going to be able to win the war.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.022
He says also because the U.S.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:44.624
and its allies are providing

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:46.059
that support to the Ukrainians.

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:47.060
And, of course, we'll continue

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.328
to provide that support as well.

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:49.696
He's obviously

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.431
one very courageous young man.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:52.065
Fred Pleitgen,

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.700
thank you very much for that report.

